WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Tree Pose — with Hani

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:10.520
Breathe in... Stand tall. Feet together.

00:00:10.520 --> 00:00:15.040
Breathe out... Shift your weight to one foot.

00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:18.560
Breathe in... Lift your foot to your calf.

00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:22.080
Breathe out... Hands together at your heart.

00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:26.600
Breathe in... Find a spot to look at.

00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:31.120
Breathe out... Steady like a tree.

00:00:31.120 --> 00:00:35.640
Breathe in... Roots grow into the floor.

00:00:35.640 --> 00:00:40.160
Breathe out... Strong and still.

00:00:40.160 --> 00:00:44.680
Breathe in... Get ready to grow.

00:00:44.680 --> 00:00:49.200
Breathe out... Soft and quiet body.

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:52.720
Breathe in... Grow your branches up high!

00:00:52.720 --> 00:00:57.240
Breathe out... Soft shoulders.

00:00:57.240 --> 00:01:01.760
Breathe in... Reach for the sun.

00:01:01.760 --> 00:01:06.280
Breathe out... Wobbling is okay.

00:01:06.280 --> 00:01:10.800
Breathe in... Sway in the breeze.

00:01:10.800 --> 00:01:15.320
Breathe out... Calm, tall tree.

00:01:15.320 --> 00:01:19.840
Breathe in... One more big breath.

00:01:19.840 --> 00:01:23.840
Breathe out... Lower your arms and foot.

00:01:23.840 --> 00:01:28.360
Breathe in... Stand tall like a mountain.

00:01:28.360 --> 00:01:32.880
Breathe out... Now the other side!

00:01:32.880 --> 00:01:36.400
Breathe in... Lift your other foot.

00:01:36.400 --> 00:01:40.920
Breathe out... Hands at your heart.

00:01:40.920 --> 00:01:45.440
Breathe in... Look at your spot.

00:01:45.440 --> 00:01:49.960
Breathe out... Steady roots.

00:01:49.960 --> 00:01:53.480
Breathe in... Grow your branches up high!

00:01:53.480 --> 00:01:58.000
Breathe out... Soft shoulders.

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:02.520
Breathe in... Reach for the sun.

00:02:02.520 --> 00:02:07.040
Breathe out... Strong roots, calm mind.

00:02:07.040 --> 00:02:11.560
Breathe in... Feel tall and proud.

00:02:11.560 --> 00:02:16.080
Breathe out... Wobbling is okay.

00:02:16.080 --> 00:02:19.600
Breathe in... Get ready to come down.

00:02:19.600 --> 00:02:23.600
Breathe out... Lower your arms and foot.

00:02:23.600 --> 00:02:28.120
Breathe in... Stand tall and smile.

00:02:28.120 --> 00:02:32.640
Breathe out... Great job, tree friend!

00:02:32.640 --> 00:02:37.640
Great job! See you next time.
